sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Tester / market
    participant E as GSR v14
    participant B as Broker execution
    T->>E: New H1 bar
    E->>E: Apply Friday, timeout, position and spread guards
    E->>E: Evaluate London range and 12:00 midpoint retest
    E->>B: Market Buy/Sell with SL and TP
    B-->>E: Fill / order result
    T->>B: Bid/Ask ticks
    B-->>E: Stop, target, timeout or Friday close
    E->>B: Close request when time/risk guard fires
    B-->>E: Exit deal and native costs
